# Cogfall is built in CI by the multi-stage Dockerfile (Node stage runs
# `npm ci && npm run build`, Python stage serves the result). Don't
# commit dist/ — Vite emits content-hashed filenames, so committed dist
# would churn on every src change and conflict between concurrent PRs.
# Local dev: `npm run dev` (Vite). Local static-server preview:
# `npm run build` first.
